<title>GERMANY: German president to pay state visit to France.</title>
<headline>German president to pay state visit to France.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>German President Roman Herzog will pay a three-day state visit to France next month at the invitation of French President Jacques Chirac, Herzog's office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Herzog and his wife Christiane will visit France from October 16 to October 19, the president's office said in a statement.</p>
